{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player wakes, not knowing that time has passed rapidly when sleeping. The player must help the last settlement that survived the drought, get back the clean water from a greedy bio mutant. Defeat enemies and save the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's in the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore:</strong>\u00a0Hidden NPCs, and messages scattered throughout the wastes. These messages or phrases are used to find out who is controlling the wasteland. find collectables and secret mysteries of the lost and mutated. With a limited inventory, use your items wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Missions and quests:</strong> There's some small and some timed missions that give hints to the main quest. Follow the missions, and you will save the wasteland... or explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stories of the forgotten:</strong> There's a few that are some of the lost survivors of the drought, that have some weird tales to tell. Find out there backstories of the few and uncover who is responsible for the lack of water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pew Pew Zap:</strong>\u00a0Some experimental weapons, hidden and found, are used to defeat roaming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That seems strange:</strong>\u00a0Random cutscenes that have funny and yet odd hints to find out what's happening in the wasteland that guide you to your destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686600/extras/859fe8450a7d3976a83ca78642658a93.webp?t=1765819961\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686600/extras/859fe8450a7d3976a83ca78642658a93.poster.avif?t=1765819961\" class=\"bb_img\" width=426 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebac